|---------|---------|---------|---------|---------|---------|---------|---------|
| S1      | 1506.22 | 70.90   | 8.44    | 260.27  | 197.47  | 71.71   | 61.19   |
| S2      | 1732.65 | 1780.72 | 567.44  | 448.68  | 29.00   | 1484.91 | 963.92  |
| S3      | 115.66  | 100.76  | 64.68   | 1324.53 | 64.99   | 134.88  | 2102.83 |
